        <mxCell id="n15" value="The library-availability lane runs before any detector file is written, because the whole&#10;phase rests on three libraries having a ready-made build for the node's processor. Had it&#10;failed, the answer was an older version, a different base image, or a long compile — a&#10;design decision, not something an implementing agent may pick on the spot." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;fillColor=#f2f4f9;strokeColor=#e3e5ea;fontColor=#3d3d46;fontSize=15.4;align=left;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="392" width="700" height="93.6" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
